      "text": "Inspiration from Netflix\nTech Blog\n\nNew tools and skills\ncould be exposed as\ncommand-line tools\nwith the base image and\na skill to list tools to\navoid maintaining\ncommon bottleneck and\nskills can be updated\nautomatically for new\nagent sessions",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Inspiration from Netflix Tech Blog\n\nNew tools and skills could be exposed as command-line tools with the base image and a skill to list tools to avoid maintaining common bottleneck and skills can be updated automatically for new agent sessions",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
