      "updated": 1791353480047,
      "created": 1791353149557,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A pack is what configures the system — a directory with a pack.toml that\ndeclares agents, formulas, and orders, plus the support files they need.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
