    },
    {
      "id": "68XhQygCAQ1OMMZ404Us8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12836.958127868636,
      "y": 409.4579766992343,
      "width": 1052.8832100054408,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 978553971,
      "version": 731,
      "versionNonce": 487173725,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791356007777,
      "created": 1791355821695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "An event is how you observe what’s happening — an immutable, append-only\nrecord fired by city activity, not something the other primitives consume. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "An event is how you observe what’s happening — an immutable, append-only record fired by city activity, not something the other primitives consume. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "odIHXxQQVZ9ptU0h5XRHF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12831.6036972885,
      "y": 510.08640623780394,
      "width": 1038.0702193174675,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1070880253,
      "version": 226,
      "versionNonce": 1205308851,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791356014596,
      "created": 1791355902703,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every event carries a monotonically increasing sequence number, so a\nwatcher can replay the stream from any point. Beads fire bead.created /\nbead.closed, sessions fire session.woke / session.crashed, convoys fire\nconvoy.created / convoy.closed, and orders fire order.fired /\norder.completed",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Every event carries a monotonically increasing sequence number, so a watcher can replay the stream from any point. Beads fire bead.created / bead.closed, sessions fire session.woke / session.crashed, convoys fire convoy.created / convoy.closed, and orders fire order.fired / order.completed",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bO38y9uDWyJ96J7A2Wc6l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12831.838246481377,
      "y": 710.55570768088,
      "width": 1009.3940406540786,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1577356595,
      "version": 215,
      "versionNonce": 1029554931,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791356012686,
      "created": 1791355921078,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Humans watch the stream with bd show --watch, the gc\nevents --follow CLI, or the dashboard; agents and bd\nhooks observe and emit too.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Humans watch the stream with bd show --watch, the gc events --follow CLI, or the dashboard; agents and bd hooks observe and emit too.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ndsTRMwbBVNs7-oR5nALt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12912.746988159717,
      "y": 885.126466201015,
      "width": 773.9637451171875,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1613474557,
      "version": 191,
      "versionNonce": 702346643,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791356010299,
      "created": 1791355974314,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Events also close the automation loop: an event-\ntriggered order reads the stream to decide when its\nformula runs — so the same notifications humans watch\ncan drive the fleet, with no specific agent role required.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Events also close the automation loop: an event-triggered order reads the stream to decide when its formula runs — so the same notifications humans watch can drive the fleet, with no specific agent role required.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
